 "notes": [
  "Grass: official catalogue (www.grass.eu hinge systems, 376 pp, distributor-hosted copy). Tiomos cup depth only 'min' values (12.6 for 110/95; 10 for 160). Corner hinges (110/90, +30/37/45, -15/30/45), 100 refrigerator, PCC, M9, M0, Nexis Click-on etc. located (pages 32-101, 168-216) but not transcribed.",
  "CAD/STEP: Hettich: DWG/DXF per article (eShop), PARTcommunity, >50 formats on request; Grass: ZIP with RAW+STEP per product group at TEC Centre; Salice: none found; Haefele: none found; Blum: none found on hinge download page.",
  "Envelope dimensions (cup/arm/plate L x W x H): only drawing labels (e.g. Grass arm 84.5, Blum boss 57x37, Salice pivot 66x38x19) - no manufacturer table of envelopes exists in the documents read."
